{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/31952","tmdb_id":31952,"title":"倚天屠龙记","original_title":"倚天屠龙记","overview":"元朝末年，江湖盛传兼得倚天剑与屠龙刀者即可号令武林，整个武林为之疯狂。张无忌（苏有朋 饰）的父母张翠山和殷素素无意卷入因屠龙刀而起的江湖纷争，年幼的张无忌目睹父母双亡，更被“玄冥二老”所伤，所幸被张三丰带往少林寺求得易筋经解毒，无意中还得到了一部失传已久的武功秘籍《九阳神功》，抱着打发无聊时光的念头，不料却练就神功，不仅清除了体内寒毒，还以超凡的武功在明教光明顶化解了武林纠葛，成为明教教主。然而，虽有绝世武功，兼得背后明教势力支持，张无忌的生活依旧步步荆棘，不仅如此，蒙古郡主赵敏（贾静雯 饰）、青梅竹马的峨眉派美人周芷若（高圆圆 饰）、表妹殷离以及少女小昭的爱慕更是使他左右为难，无法取舍……","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1u3mRlDQWVbrZB8FtNRpYFYTIBq.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yvgw8M7Hb5xzMhh18KuJntqrgIm.jpg","first_air_date":"2003-03-12","last_air_date":"2003-04-04","year":"2003","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":40,"number_of_seasons":1,"tmdb_rating_average":7.8,"tmdb_votes":23,"tmdb_rating":"7.8 / 10 from 23 users","genres":["剧情"],"languages":["Mandarin"],"countries":[],"production_companies":[],"directors":[{"name":"杨韬","id":2680280},{"name":"赖水清","id":1261159}],"producers":[],"cast":[{"id":102296,"name":"苏有朋","original_name":"蘇有朋","character":"张无忌","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/sgiYxajhi61gI5DcuVYBloneX4s.jpg"},{"id":1251592,"name":"贾静雯","original_name":"賈靜雯","character":"赵敏","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/3xcy2tgo5fLMNBiO5cLCzdUoOI.jpg"},{"id":74022,"name":"高圆圆","original_name":"高圆圆","character":"周芷若","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/7vI1FrBmI3VecC1J35oR7iDRytw.jpg"},{"id":593166,"name":"陈紫函","original_name":"陈紫函","character":"殷离","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/xItbxt0SQa6FlA4w0rrlDRH0ghY.jpg"},{"id":2041116,"name":"陈秀丽","original_name":"陈秀丽","character":"小昭","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/h3UbEovxIt9NihGt3kFbdtsKmZa.jpg"},{"id":1236261,"name":"张铁林","original_name":"张铁林","character":"杨逍","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/fj8tjQc58Ym0Ujmpfstn24sW0TR.jpg"},{"id":543178,"name":"张国立","original_name":"张国立","character":